<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Klipton lifts first half earning 17.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Klipton lifts first half earning 17.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     23.5	  vs 20.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.53	  vs 3.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.53	  vs 3.05</p>
<p>    Tax			  -	    vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.69	  vs 1.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		  88.31	 vs 83.73</p>
<p>Full name: Klipton Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was its policy to pay one dividend a year. Second half earnings are expected to at least match the first half.</p>
<p>Klipton said unspecified negotiations involving its security business were still continuing.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
